  "details": "When calibrating full-body tracking, please add a temporary local transparent avatar mirror, that stays for a few seconds after confirming the pose.\nSometimes in worlds without a mirror, or any circumstance that I may not be able to use it in the world, I normally wing it when calibrating and hope my body is being properly tracked.\n\nI'm sure most of us would like to see a temporary frame of reference after calibration.",
